        "size": "cuboidal precipitates in the range of 10 nm",
        "morphology": "cuboidal precipitates",
        "location": null,
        "composition": "Fe 67.9, Al 23.3, Ti 8.8 at.%",
        "identification_status": "experimental"
      },
      "evidence": [
        {
          "page": 3,
          "section": "III. RESULTS AND DISCUSSION",
          "quote": "It is therefore concluded that both alloys have a coherent A2 + L21 microstructure. This conclusion is proved by recent transmission electron microscopy (TEM) investigations on a number of Fe-Al-Ti alloys, including the composition Fe-23Al-8.5Ti.",
